{"version":1,"content":"<p>你有沒有在乘坐高鐵的時候遇到過類似的尷尬場景，插上座椅旁的USB口給手機充電，等了半天不僅電量沒往上漲，反而越充越少甚至還往下掉。<strong>近日有不少網友在社交平台發帖吐槽自己的類似遭遇，高鐵座椅自帶的USB充電口給手機充電越充耗電的相關話題很快衝上熱門，引發了大量有同款經歷的乘客共鳴。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585814.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T15:02:16.771449+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T14:37:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T14:55:39.623274+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T14:55:39.623274+00:00","content_hash":"64217e8eb054cd44d3852170ce201d2225d0481b937df5387b08a9ebc3480fc0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}